im! (him is strong)\n                       B: Where?  | can’t see him. (him is weak)\n                       A: Do you  know  that woman?                                       ea\n                       B: Her? No, I don’t recognise her. (first her is strong,             ai\n                          second her is weak)                                 Ne?\n                       A: I’m afraid we can’t stay any longer. (we is weak)  They toid us to go this way.\n                       B: What  do you mean, ‘we’? I’ve got plenty of time.\n                          (we is strong)\n                       A: They rold us to go this way. (us is weak)\n                       B: Well, they didn’t tell us! (us is strong)\n                       When  I said, ‘Give them A drink’ I didn’t mean                   =~)   )\n                       | meant the people. (first them is weak, second them\n                       is strong)                                                   B     wll                \\\\\n\n\n              82         English Pronunciation in Use (Elementary)", "char_count": 3014, "mean_conf": 87.84, "word_count": 337, "words": [{"text": "Hey,", "x0": 439, "y0": 281, "x1": 576, "y1": 361, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "wait", "x0": 607, "y0": 281, "x1": 755, "y1": 343, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "for", "x0": 782, "y0": 280, "x1": 883, "y1": 342, "conf": 95, "bold": false}, {"text": "me!", "x0": 914, "y0": 280, "x1": 1037, "y1": 342, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "Strong", "x0": 438, "y0": 368, "x1": 662, "y1": 446, "conf": 95, "bold": false}, {"text": "and", "x0": 697, "y0": 368, "x1": 818, "y1": 428, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "weak", "x0": 853, "y0": 368, "x1": 1027, "y1": 427, "conf": 96, "bold": false}, {"text": "forms", "x0": 1056, "y0": 368, "x1": 1252, "y1": 427, "conf": 95, "bold": false}, {"text": "1:", "x0": 1291, "y0": 372, "x1": 1346, "y1": 427, "conf": 95, "bold": false}, {"text": "Pronouns", "x0": 1381, "y0": 